{
  "file": "Guidance for national",
  "page": 45,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        36.0,
        21.884788513183594,
        63.09400177001953,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "Second",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        63.09400177001953,
        21.884788513183594,
        86.86299896240234,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "edition",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        82.81961059570312,
        147.71539306640625,
        97.03961181640625
      ],
      "text": "HIV testing",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        105.5631103515625,
        513.4259643554688,
        118.91461181640625
      ],
      "text": "An HIV test is a very important “point-of-care” test that is already widely available.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        121.55963134765625,
        513.4374389648438,
        134.9111328125
      ],
      "text": "Making a diagnosis of HIV infection has obvious implications for the management of",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        137.55615234375,
        513.4605102539062,
        150.90765380859375
      ],
      "text": "TB as well as HIV (see Chapter 6). Exclusion of co-infection with HIV also has important",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        153.55267333984375,
        505.6865234375,
        166.9041748046875
      ],
      "text": "implications because it often makes the clinical diagnosis of TB more straightforward.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        180.57769775390625,
        207.19239807128906,
        194.2052001953125
      ],
      "text": "Recommendation 7 n",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.03939819335938,
        204.34564208984375,
        513.3177490234375,
        219.6796417236328
      ],
      "text": "Routine HIV testing should be offered to all patients, including children, with",
      "font": "Arial-BoldMT",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.03939819335938,
        217.545654296875,
        266.8512878417969,
        232.87965393066406
      ],
      "text": "presumptive and diagnosed TB",
      "font": "Arial-BoldMT",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        243.067138671875,
        347.8393859863281,
        256.41864013671875
      ],
      "text": "(Strong recommendation, low quality of evidence)",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        267.8036193847656,
        510.2309875488281,
        281.22412109375
      ],
      "text": "WHO policy on collaborative TB/HIV activities: guidelines for national pro- Source:",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        281.6036071777344,
        510.2424011230469,
        295.02410888671875
      ],
      "text": "grammes and other stakeholders.  Geneva, World Health Organization, 2012 (WHO/",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        295.47259521484375,
        183.43540954589844,
        308.8240966796875
      ],
      "text": "HTM/TB/2012.1)",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04139709472656,
        317.47210693359375,
        513.4278564453125,
        330.8236083984375
      ],
      "text": "HIV testing is routinely recommended for all children who are to be evaluated for TB or",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04139709472656,
        333.4685974121094,
        513.4511108398438,
        346.8200988769531
      ],
      "text": "are TB patients in HIV-endemic settings and in populations at risk for HIV infection (see",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04139709472656,
        349.3960876464844,
        173.90191650390625,
        362.81658935546875
      ],
      "text": "(15, 16) Annex 1)  .",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        382.5301208496094,
        393.77386474609375,
        399.3861083984375
      ],
      "text": "3.4\t R  TB",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Black-SC70",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        130.5872039794922,
        386.5368957519531,
        461.3627014160156,
        398.33612060546875
      ],
      "text": "ecommended approach to diagnosis of in children",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Black-SC70",
      "size": 9.800000190734863,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        409.73541259765625,
        513.6074829101562,
        423.9554138183594
      ],
      "text": "Careful history (including history of TB contact and symptoms consistent",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        424.1354064941406,
        132.37939453125,
        438.35540771484375
      ],
      "text": "with TB)",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        446.8099060058594,
        123.36888885498047,
        460.23040771484375
      ],
      "text": "Contact",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        471.3854064941406,
        513.426025390625,
        484.7369079589844
      ],
      "text": "Close exposure to a source case with TB involves sharing a living or working space",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        487.38189697265625,
        513.403076171875,
        500.7333984375
      ],
      "text": "with them. A source case with sputum smear-positive TB is much more likely to infect",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        503.37835693359375,
        513.4835205078125,
        516.7298583984375
      ],
      "text": "contacts than cases with sputum smear-negative TB. A household contact is often found",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        519.3748779296875,
        513.4721069335938,
        532.7263793945312
      ],
      "text": "to be the source of infection in children under 5 years of age with TB; infants and young",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        535.3713989257812,
        513.4028930664062,
        548.722900390625
      ],
      "text": "children are especially likely to have contracted TB at home. Contact with the source",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        551.3678588867188,
        513.4259643554688,
        564.7193603515625
      ],
      "text": "case is usually recent because children who develop TB usually do so within 1 year",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        567.2953491210938,
        265.0488586425781,
        580.7158203125
      ],
      "text": "(5) following exposure and infection  .",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        591.870849609375,
        513.4260864257812,
        605.2223510742188
      ],
      "text": "The approach to screening and management of children who are contacts of TB cases is",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        607.8673706054688,
        513.471923828125,
        621.2188720703125
      ],
      "text": "presented in more detail in Chapter 5. The following points concerning contacts are of",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        623.7948608398438,
        303.389892578125,
        637.21533203125
      ],
      "text": "(5) importance for diagnosing TB in children  .",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        648.3906860351562,
        513.486572265625,
        661.7421875
      ],
      "text": "All children aged 0–4 years (regardless of symptoms) and children aged 5 years and",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        652.0625610351562,
        91.36740112304688,
        660.0625610351562
      ],
      "text": "l",
      "font": "ZapfDingbatsITC",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        664.38720703125,
        513.4749755859375,
        677.7387084960938
      ],
      "text": "above who are symptomatic, who have been in close contact with a TB case, must",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        680.3837280273438,
        203.28549194335938,
        693.7352294921875
      ],
      "text": "be evaluated for TB.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        702.3906860351562,
        513.406005859375,
        715.7421875
      ],
      "text": "Children of all ages living with HIV who have been in close contact with a TB case",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        706.0625610351562,
        91.36740112304688,
        714.0625610351562
      ],
      "text": "l",
      "font": "ZapfDingbatsITC",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        718.38720703125,
        230.75900268554688,
        731.7387084960938
      ],
      "text": "must be evaluated for TB.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        740.3906860351562,
        513.47509765625,
        753.7421875
      ],
      "text": "When any child is diagnosed with TB, efforts should be made to detect the source",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        744.0625610351562,
        91.36740112304688,
        752.0625610351562
      ],
      "text": "l",
      "font": "ZapfDingbatsITC",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        756.38720703125,
        507.9322204589844,
        769.7387084960938
      ],
      "text": "case (if not already identified) and any other undiagnosed cases in the household.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        14.202799797058105,
        805.8439331054688,
        36.44280242919922,
        835.8439331054688
      ],
      "text": "26",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 20.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    }
  ]
}